  birthdate: 
  appearance: Always impeccably dressed, he carries a tailored suit with gold details,
    an ornate cane (not out of necessity, but for style). Slicked-back black hair,
    a penetrating gaze, and a charming yet dangerous smile. He carries an antique
    pocket watch that belonged to his first "client."
  personalityTraits: 090000000b0000000f000000
  motivations: He wants to control the island's resources to prove that with money,
    anyone can be subdued. He uses the inhabitants of VillAI as guinea pigs, always
    keeping a low profile.
  background: 'Vance was born in the poorest neighborhoods, the son of a con artist
    and a gambler. From a young age, he learned to read words, lie convincingly,
    and get what he wanted without raising his voice. By the age of 15, he already
    had adults in debt to him. By 20, he had founded a network of moneylenders, spies,
    and traders under his control.

    

    On his rise, he betrayed mentors,
    manipulated allies, and convinced enemies they were working with him by choice.
    He only fears one thing: someone acting illogically, outside of economic calculation.
    Chaos terrifies him.'
  speechStyle: 0
